; The visible way into the card -- F1 is a shortcut, not a secret.
; The reference's notification stack: down the right-hand edge, under the score, and
; growing downward from the top rather than upward from the bar that no longer exists.
; **Hidden at the user's request** (August 2026) -- the lines read as out of place over
; the city. Hidden rather than deleted, the same way PortraitBlock was: `HUD.gd` reaches
; it with `$`, the suite holds it as a fixture, and the log keeps composing its lines out
; of sight, so unhiding it is one word. Everything it announces is also visible on the
; call board, which is why it can go without losing information.
